* >Natural Source Code: ORDUPD
* SUBPROGRAM: ORDUPD - ORDER HEADER UPDATE
* DESCRIPTION: NON-INTERACTIVE ORDER HEADER UPDATE
*              USED BY BATCH AND API CALLERS
* LIBRARY: RETAILCORE
* ADABAS FILE: 111 (ORDER)
* CREATED: 2001-03-10  A. GARCIA
* MODIFIED: 2008-11-15 - ADDED PAYMENT UPDATE
* MODIFIED: 2016-04-22 - ADDED SHIPPING ADDRESS UPDATE
* -------------------------------------------------------
DEFINE DATA
PARAMETER
  1 P-ORDER-ID            (N10)
  1 P-UPD-TYPE            (A4)
  1 P-STATUS              (A3)
  1 P-AMT                 (N11.2)
  1 P-TEXT                 (A60)
  1 P-DATE                (D)
  1 P-RC                  (N4)
  1 P-RC-TEXT             (A80)
*
LOCAL
  1 #USER-ID              (A8)
  1 #ORD-STR              (A15)
  1 #OLD-VALUE            (A20)
  1 #NEW-VALUE            (A20)
  1 #POST-FLAG            (A1)
  1 #POST-MSG             (A60)
*
  1 OU-VIEW VIEW OF ORDER-FILE
    2 OU-ID                (N10)
    2 OU-STATUS            (A3)
    2 OU-TOTAL-AMT         (N11.2)
    2 OU-PAID-AMT          (N11.2)
    2 OU-DISCOUNT-AMT      (N9.2)
    2 OU-TAX-AMT           (N9.2)
    2 OU-PRIORITY          (N1)
    2 OU-NOTES             (A200)
END-DEFINE
*
MOVE *USER TO #USER-ID
RESET P-RC
RESET P-RC-TEXT
*
* GET ORDER
FIND OU-VIEW WITH OU-ID = P-ORDER-ID
  IF NO RECORDS FOUND
    MOVE 404 TO P-RC
    MOVE 'ORDER NOT FOUND' TO P-RC-TEXT
    ESCAPE ROUTINE
  END-NOREC
*
  GET OU-VIEW *ISN (HOLD)
*
  DECIDE ON FIRST VALUE OF P-UPD-TYPE
    VALUE 'STAT'
      * STATUS UPDATE VIA ORDPOST
      CALLNAT 'ORDPOST' P-ORDER-ID P-STATUS #POST-FLAG #POST-MSG
      IF #POST-FLAG NE 'Y'
        MOVE 420 TO P-RC
        MOVE #POST-MSG TO P-RC-TEXT
        BACKOUT TRANSACTION
      END-IF
      ESCAPE BOTTOM
*
    VALUE 'PAID'
      * PAYMENT AMOUNT UPDATE
      MOVE OU-PAID-AMT TO #OLD-VALUE
      ADD P-AMT TO OU-PAID-AMT
      MOVE OU-PAID-AMT TO #NEW-VALUE
      UPDATE OU-VIEW
*
    VALUE 'TOTL'
      * TOTAL RECALCULATION
      MOVE OU-TOTAL-AMT TO #OLD-VALUE
      MOVE P-AMT TO OU-TOTAL-AMT
      MOVE OU-TOTAL-AMT TO #NEW-VALUE
      UPDATE OU-VIEW
*
    VALUE 'PRIO'
      * PRIORITY UPDATE
      MOVE OU-PRIORITY TO #OLD-VALUE
      IF P-AMT >= 1 AND P-AMT <= 3
        MOVE P-AMT TO OU-PRIORITY
      ELSE
        MOVE 405 TO P-RC
        MOVE 'INVALID PRIORITY (1-3)' TO P-RC-TEXT
        BACKOUT TRANSACTION
        ESCAPE BOTTOM
      END-IF
      MOVE OU-PRIORITY TO #NEW-VALUE
      UPDATE OU-VIEW
*
    VALUE 'NOTE'
      * ADD NOTE
      MOVE OU-NOTES TO #OLD-VALUE
      MOVE P-TEXT TO OU-NOTES
      UPDATE OU-VIEW
*
    NONE VALUE
      MOVE 405 TO P-RC
      COMPRESS 'INVALID UPDATE TYPE:' P-UPD-TYPE INTO P-RC-TEXT
      BACKOUT TRANSACTION
      ESCAPE BOTTOM
  END-DECIDE
*
  END OF TRANSACTION
*
  * AUDIT
  MOVE P-ORDER-ID TO #ORD-STR
  CALLNAT 'AUDITN' 'ORD' #ORD-STR 'U' P-UPD-TYPE
    #OLD-VALUE #NEW-VALUE P-TEXT
*
  ESCAPE BOTTOM
END-FIND
*
END
